	| Summary   | AlloyEditor source button fails on Firefox and safari for Mac OS |
	| Component | Frontend Infrastructure > WYSIWYG                                |
	| Release   | Fix Pack 75                                                      |
	| Key       | LPS-90239                                                        |
	And the changelog entry with the content "Can not create a Data Provider if the default language is set to Spanish" should be visible with the following values
	| Summary   | Can not create a Data Provider if the default language is set to Spanish |
	| Component | Forms                                                                    |
	| Release   | Fix Pack 75                                                              |
	| Key       | LPS-76813                                                                |
	When I go to the next page of the search results
	Then the current page number of the results page should be page "2"
	And the changelog entry with the content "Publication fails when a Web Content with a Document is displayed in a Web Content Display and an Asset Publisher as well" should be visible with the following values
	| Summary   | Publication fails when a Web Content with a Document is displayed in a Web Content Display and an Asset Publisher as well |
	| Component | Staging                                                                                                                   |
	| Release   | Fix Pack 74                                                                                                               |
	| Key       | LPS-82958                                                                                                                 |
	And the changelog entry with the content "JS error when selecting pagination limit" should be visible with the following values
	| Summary   | JS error when selecting pagination limit |
	| Component | Frontend Infrastructure	               |
	| Release   | Fix Pack 73                              |
	| Key       | LPS-89876                                |
	And the changelog entry with the content "Same scheduler job may be executed in two threads at the same time" should be visible with the following values
	| Summary   | Same scheduler job may be executed in two threads at the same time |
	| Component | Portal Services > Scheduler	                  	                 |
	| Release   | Fix Pack 73                                                        |
	| Key       | LPS-89033                                                          |
	And the changelog entry with the content "Unable to acquire state change lock for the module when starting a bundle" should be visible with the following values
	| Summary   | Unable to acquire state change lock for the module when starting a bundle |
	| Component | Core Infrastructure > Portal Bootstrap		                            |
