	| Component | DM		  		                                           |
	| Release   | Fix Pack 72	                                               |
	| Key       | LPS-88484                                                    |
	When I go to the next page of the search results
	Then the current page number of the results page should be page "3"
	And the changelog entry with the content "Liferay 7 service-ext.properties not considered" should be visible with the following values
	| Summary   | Liferay 7 service-ext.properties not considered |
	| Component | Core Infrastructure > Service Builder           |
	| Release   | Fix Pack 72                                     |
	| Key       | LPS-69035                                       |
