	And the changelog entry with the content "Merge Public Pages results in wrong Navigation Menu" should be in position number "6"
	And the changelog entry with the content "Error Message after the session expires is not translated" should be in position number "14"
	And the changelog entry with the content "AlloyEditor source button fails on Firefox and safari for Mac OS" should be in position number "25"
	And the changelog entry with the content "Security vulnerabilities in Spring core" should be in position number "37"
	And the changelog entry with the content "Can not create a Data Provider if the default language is set to Spanish" should be in position number "43"

